{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04249","headline":"宿山庄 · 骆宾王","name":"宿山庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金陵一超忽，玉烛几还周。\n露积吴台草，风入郢门楸。\n林虚宿断雾，磴险挂悬流。\n拾青非汉策，化缁类秦裘。\n牵迹犹多蹇，劳生未寡尤。\n独此他乡梦，空山明月秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}